<section id="post-by-email" class="mt-20 md:mt-28 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20 items-center">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 md:order-last">
    <h2 class="source-serif font-semibold text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-tight leading-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Post by sending an email</h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      <p>Email is already on every device you use. Send a message to your private Pagecord address and it becomes a post on your blog.</p>
      <p>Text formatting, images and links all look great!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="home-envelope" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="home-envelope__post">
      <span class="home-envelope__blog">HARBOUR LIGHT</span>
      <span class="home-envelope__title">The long way round</span>
      <span class="home-envelope__date">21 September 2026</span>
      <p>I took the coast road home last weekend, instead of the motorway. It added an hour and a half to my journey, but it was amazing.</p>
    </div>
    <%= render "letters/envelope", address: "harbourlight_9y38ue9i@post.pagecord.com", open: true %>
  </div>
</section>

<%= render layout: "home/feature", locals: { id: "post-by-editor", title: "A wonderful editor for writing, built in", image: "home/rich-text-editor.webp", alt: "A screenshot of Pagecord's rich text editor", size: "1600x968" } do %>
  <p>Pagecord has a wonderful online editor for writing posts in your browser, or on your phone. Use Markdown syntax, add formatting, images, galleries, tables, colours, and code blocks with syntax highlighting.</p>
<% end %>

<%= render layout: "home/feature", locals: { id: "follow", title: "Allow people to follow, calmly", image: "home/weekly-digest.webp", alt: "A screenshot of Apple Mail with a weekly digest email", size: "1600x967", flip: true } do %>
  <p>Every Pagecord blog has RSS, but not everyone uses it. With Pagecord Premium, readers can subscribe to your blog by email and receive an automatic <strong>weekly digest</strong>. If you prefer, you can send posts individually instead, on your schedule.</p>
<% end %>

<%= render layout: "home/feature", locals: { id: "analytics", title: "Privacy-respecting analytics built in", image: "home/analytics.webp", alt: "A screenshot of Pagecord's page view analytics page", size: "1600x968" } do %>
  <p>It's nice to know how many visitors your blog gets, and where they come from, but you shouldn't have to add costly 3rd party tracking scripts.</p>
  <p>Pagecord Premium has simple, privacy-first analytics built in. And if you would rather not know, you can turn it all off.</p>
<% end %>

<section id="features" class="mt-20 md:mt-28 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4">
  <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
    <h2 class="source-serif font-semibold text-3xl tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">Also enclosed</h2>
    <%= link_to "See every feature", features_path, class: "home-link text-sm" %>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-9">
    <% [
      [ "Obsidian, iA Writer and the API", "Publish straight from the official Obsidian plugin or iA Writer. Tinkerers can use Shortcuts, scripts and the API too.", "obsidian-api" ],
      [ "Custom domains", "If you'd prefer to use your own domain name for your site, set it up in one click.", "compare" ],
      [ "Pages", "Create standalone pages for About, Now, Contact, archives, tags, and more with dynamic variables.", "compare" ],
      [ "Themes", "Style your blog with colour themes and fonts, then choose a layout and page width that suit your writing.", "compare" ],
      [ "Media embeds", "Links to YouTube, Spotify, Bandcamp and GitHub are automatically embedded. Great for sharing your favourite tunes and videos.", "compare" ],
      [ "Full site export", "Export your entire Pagecord blog as HTML or Markdown, with images included.", "compare" ]
    ].each do |name, description, anchor| %>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
        <h3 class="source-serif font-semibold text-xl text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
          <%= link_to name, features_path(anchor:), class: "decoration-pagecord-accent decoration-2 underline-offset-4 hover:underline" %>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400"><%= description %></p>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</section>
